{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "project-hotelling-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.55: `project-hotelling`, `project-offnetwork` without its evaporative processes, computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE plus the same PROJECT input database (`inputs/washtenaw-project-offnetwork.esm`). It selects source types 21 (gasoline) and 62 (diesel), road types 1 and 4, and Total Energy for running exhaust, extended idle and APU. Its 266 MOVESOutput rows are running exhaust on link 1 (road type 4; source type 62 at 10% of the volume) and extended idle and APU on the off-network link 2.\n\nWHAT IT EXERCISES, selected by `run_isProjectDomain`: ProjectTAG's hotelling hours (`hot_projectHours`: the off-network fleet of source type 62 x extendedIdleFraction x ageFraction x days, summed over the fuel split), the hotelling operating modes on a project database whose hotellingActivityDistribution is empty at the run's zone, and a source type with eleven physics rows on the link distribution (brackets 305/306 for source type 62).\n\n`n_outputRate` IS 266. `run_domainUnported` is 0.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "project-domain"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-hotelling/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-hotelling/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, monthID 8.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-hotelling/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourID 9. `<beginhour key=\"8\">` is a 0-based index into the sorted hour list (docs/mixed-onroad.md 0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-hotelling/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationhour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The hours the run aggregates over. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspechour` itself and the same file.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-hotelling/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechourday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, dayID 5 (weekday). The second factor of the activity axis and of the output axis, and its extent is one in this run: `<day id=\"5\">` selects one day type where the earlier `<day key=\"5\">` was an out-of-range INDEX and fell back to both (moves.rs PR #55).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_rateday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-hotelling/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_rateday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The day types the RATE-side time pre-aggregation is scoped to. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspecday` itself and the same file: the pre-aggregation averages over one cell and returns the table's own value. A run that aggregates points this somewhere else, because MOVES overwrites `runspecday` with the synthesized output day AFTER the pre-aggregation has run.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_actday": {
      "kind": "static",
